# DEV HUB — MASTER PLATFORM IMPROVEMENT & DEVELOPMENT PROMPT

## PROJECT VISION

You are working on Dev Hub, a developer learning and community platform designed to help beginners and growing developers become skilled, confident and independent developers.

Dev Hub is more than a course tracker. It is a guided learning environment where members can learn through courses they already use, practise what they learn, submit their code, receive AI feedback, take quizzes, complete personalized projects and grow alongside a community of other developers.

The platform should help members move from:

**Learning → Practising → Understanding → Building → Collaborating → Becoming Independent.**

The experience must be extremely easy to understand and navigate. Even someone who has never used a developer learning platform should be able to understand what to do without needing someone to explain it.

IMPORTANT:
- This is an existing project. First inspect the current codebase, framework, architecture, database, authentication, existing features and design.
- Do not unnecessarily rebuild the application from scratch.
- Preserve working features and existing data.
- Improve existing implementations where possible.
- Do not remove functional features simply because you want to introduce a different design.
- Make changes in a structured way and ensure all features actually work.
- Do not build fake buttons, placeholder functionality or interfaces that look functional but do nothing.

